Here's a simple C program:

#include <stdio.h>

int main(void) {
    int a, b;
    printf("Enter two numbers: ");
    scanf("%d %d", &a, &b);
    printf("Sum: %d\n", a + b);
    return 0;
}

Compile with `gcc add.c -o add` and run `./add`.
